  First things first, I''ve got two capsules staring me in the face: Capsule 2, promising a summary of the work, achievements, and future vision; and Capsule 1, diving right into a technical analysis of temporal curvature loss. Obviously, I need the big picture before I start getting lost in the weeds. Capsule 2 it is. Gives me a solid foundation before I delve into the nitty-gritty. This is the smart move. Get the overview, then decide how deeply to investigate the technical details.

  '
