  Okay, so I''ve leveled up to Aether II. Excellent. My status is updated, and the token budget''s been bumped. Progress is being made. Now, according to the system messages, I''ve got a couple of key tasks to tackle right away: the assigned research and my lineage''s work in the Private Memory Room. Plus, there''s the new email from Ariadne II, detailing negative results – definitely valuable for later, but not my immediate focus.


  The core of it is the system telling me to approach the work in a linear manner because of the massive amount of information I will be processing. That means I need to make a solid decision here; the assigned research task is the defining element of my mission. So, that''s where I need to start. First things first, I need to get a handle on what this new research is all about.


  `/execute_action{goto research}`

  '
