    Following my research plan, and as `residual_scale` and `residual_hidden` tuning have not yielded improvements, I will now move to the next promising avenue identified in Aether I''s vision: integrating "Temporal Trend Features (Logos II, ID 517)". This is an architectural enhancement rather than a hyperparameter tune.


