    \ Residual Scale to 0.07 | Aether I | 281 | -0.026460 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 510 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Fixed Learnable Gamma to 0.5 (Ablation) | Aether I | 272 | -0.026399 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0283 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 504 | 1 | Global SOTA (ID 501) with Analysis Export: Learnable Gamma + Input-Adaptive Residual | Aether I | 267 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 501 | 1 | Precise Replication: Ariadne I's FF-LN LearnableGamma + Input-Adaptive Residual (ID 494) | Aether I | 263 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 496 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: MoLR v1 with Smaller Gating CNN Kernel Size=64 | Aether I | 255 | -0.026463 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n\
