    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/logos/mofl_components.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 618 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Input-Adaptive Residual with Temporal Trend Features | Aether II | 347 | -0.026256 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 611 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 48 | Aether II | 344 | -0.026267 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0279 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 610 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.025 |\
    \ Aether II | 342 | -0.026378 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 609 | 1 | Reproduction of Aether I's Global SOTA (ID 501) | Aether II | 340 | -0.026240 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0279 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 528 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.025 | Aether I | 288 | -0.026378 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 525 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 16 | Aether I | 284 | -0.026362 | 0.0197 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 522 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.07 | Aether I | 281 | -0.026460 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 510 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Fixed Learnable Gamma to 0.5 (Ablation) | Aether I | 272 | -0.026399 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0283 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 504 | 1 | Global SOTA (ID 501) with Analysis Export: Learnable Gamma + Input-Adaptive Residual | Aether I | 267 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255\
    \ |\n| 501 | 1 | Precise Replication: Ariadne I's FF-LN LearnableGamma + Input-Adaptive Residual (ID 494) | Aether I | 263 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/logos/mofl_components.py:**\n```\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    hidden_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    pool_window: int\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        # Input x shape: (B, T_in, N)\n        # Transpose for 1D conv over the neuron axis\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1)) # (B, N, T_in)\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(gater_input)\n    \
    \    y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(self.pool_window,), strides=(self.pool_window,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1)) # Flatten\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
