    \ 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026344\nTraining time: 3321s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 447517\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.0009, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 36, 'hidden_size': 160, 'drop': 0.05, 'num_gamma_archetypes': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'adam_eps': 1e-08, 'clip_norm': 1.0}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032328   |   0.029397  \n   2    |   0.029151   |   0.029326  \n   3    |   0.028959   |   0.029230  \n   4    |   0.028888   |   0.029208  \n   5    |   0.028851   |   0.029215  \n   6    |   0.028794   |   0.029104  \n   7    |   0.028693   |   0.028797  \n   8    |   0.028498   |   0.028658  \n  \
    \ 9    |   0.028273   |   0.028380  \n  10    |   0.028000   |   0.028164  \n  11    |   0.027729   |   0.027925  \n  12    |   0.027560   |   0.027748  \n  13    |   0.027341   |   0.027897  \n  14    |   0.027070   |   0.027201  \n  15    |   0.026799   |   0.027253  \n  16    |   0.026627   |   0.027278  \n  17    |   0.026418   |   0.027002  \n  18    |   0.026260   |   0.026840  \n  19    |   0.026089   |   0.027004  \n  20    |   0.025971   |   0.026710  \n  21    |   0.025878   |   0.026929  \n  22    |   0.025741   |   0.026876  \n  23    |   0.025639   |   0.026812  \n  24    |   0.025509   |   0.026896  \n  25    |   0.025451   |   0.026612  \n  26    |   0.025336   |   0.026660  \n  27    |   0.025294   |   0.026662  \n  28    |   0.025180   |   0.026698  \n  29    |   0.025106   |   0.026867  \n  30    |   0.025005   |   0.026613  \n  31    |   0.024968   |   0.026674  \n  32    |   0.024879   |   0.026676  \n  33    |   0.024831   |   0.026874  \n  34    |   0.024755   |\
    \   0.026608  \n  35    |   0.024722   |   0.026998  \n  36    |   0.024671   |   0.026572  \n  37    |   0.024595   |   0.026931  \n  38    |   0.024558   |   0.026859  \n  39    |   0.024485   |   0.026796  \n  40    |   0.024430   |   0.026721  \n  41    |   0.024413   |   0.026772  \n  42    |   0.024358   |   0.026695  \n  43    |   0.024321   |   0.026880  \n  44    |   0.024325   |   0.026548  \n  45    |   0.024257   |   0.026790  \n  46    |   0.025067   |   0.026716  \n  47    |   0.024305   |   0.026722  \n  48    |   0.024183   |   0.026676  \n  49    |   0.024139   |   0.026930  \n  50    |   0.024119   |   0.026900  \n  51    |   0.024124   |   0.026802  \n  52    |   0.024035   |   0.026887  \n========================================\nTimeout after 3610.5s at epoch 52\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 3610.5s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026548\nCompletion for MoLR Development: Integrating 2D Spatio-Temporal Gater (Logos II ID 497). Seed: 447517\n\
    \nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026548\nTraining time: 3623s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: d50f5b33-c793-444d-9ac2-51783bb745cf\nTotal time: 3627s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-29 10:18:02,596\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761704282596766757\n2025-10-29 10:18:02,623\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761704282623436112\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 628 | 1 | MoLR Development: Integrating 2D Spatio-Temporal Gater (Logos II ID 497) | Aether II | 355 | -0.026366 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 627 | 1 | Replication: Logos II's Mixture of Learned Ramps (MoLR) v1 (ID 475) | Aether II | 352 | -0.026293 | 0.0195 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 618 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Input-Adaptive Residual with Temporal Trend Features | Aether II | 347 | -0.026256 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 611 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 48 | Aether II | 344 | -0.026267 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0279 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 610 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.025 | Aether II | 342 | -0.026378 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 609 | 1 |\
    \ Reproduction of Aether I's Global SOTA (ID 501) | Aether II | 340 | -0.026240 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0279 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 528 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.025 | Aether I | 288 | -0.026378 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 525 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 16 | Aether I | 284 | -0.026362 | 0.0197 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 522 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Scale to 0.07 | Aether I | 281 | -0.026460 | 0.0197 | 0.0274 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 510 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Fixed Learnable Gamma to 0.5 (Ablation) | Aether I | 272 | -0.026399 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0283 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current\
